Package: expfamily
Type: Package
Title: Experiments Family for jamovi
Version: 1.0.0
Author: Mingchao Sun
Maintainer: Mingchao Sun <mingchao.sun@hotmail.com>
URL: https://github.com/mingchao-sun/expfamily
BugReports: https://github.com/mingchao-sun/expfamily/issues
Description: Analysis of randomized experiments for jamovi: treatment effects with
    regression adjustment (Lin, 2013) and heteroskedasticity- and cluster-robust inference,
    randomization inference, adjusted p-values for several outcomes (Holm, Westfall-Young,
    Romano-Wolf), power and sample size, and balance and attrition checks.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    jmvcore (>= 2.3.4),
    R6,
    ggplot2
